# Circle of Power: "You draw two cards and you lose 2 life. Create a 0/1 black Wizard ... Wizards you control get +1/+0 and gain
# lifelink until end of turn." Bot1 made a Wizard token on turn 1 (Mage Siege). Bot2's Hero, a Wizard through Black Mage's Rod,
# is 2/1. On turn 3 Bot1's Circle of Power draws two (hand 6 -> 7 after casting... see Expect), loses 2 (20 -> 18), makes the
# second Wizard, and both of Bot1's Wizards get +1/+0 and lifelink: the older one attacks for 1 and Bot1 gains 1 (19), Bot2
# 19; Bot2's Hero stays 2/1 without lifelink. On turn 5 the effect has ended: both tokens are 0/1 again with no keywords.

